2026-02-08  Kamila Szewczyk  <k@iczelia.net>

	* Version 0.0.1 released.

	* src/arbint_addsub_avx2.c: AVX2-optimized doubling operation with
	runtime dispatch and threshold-based selection (16+ limbs).
	* src/arbint_mul.c: Add arbint_mul_i32 and arbint_mul_u32 for efficient
	scalar multiplication with sign handling and early-exit optimizations.
	* src/arbint_tdiv.c: Barrett-style reciprocal division optimization for
	single-limb divisors (Granlund-Montgomery algorithm).
	* configure.ac: AVX2 feature detection, MSVC compatibility improvements.
	* tests/: Add compute_pi example (Chudnovsky algorithm), AVX2 unit tests,
	stochastic testing improvements.
	* .github/workflows/: Expand CI matrix to include ppc64le, riscv64, s390x,
	MSVC x86/x64, and additional optimization configurations.
	* man/c-arbint.3.in: Document all implemented APIs including new scalar
	multiplication variants.

2026-02-07  Kamila Szewczyk  <k@iczelia.net>

	* configure.ac: Add --enable-lto=auto|yes|no and LTO capability check.
	* src/Makefile.am: Apply LTO compile/link flags to libarbint.
	* tests/Makefile.am: Apply LTO compile/link flags to test binaries.
	* README: Add build/install/basic usage instructions and configure options.
	* NEWS: Add v0.1 release notes.

2026-02-06  Kamila Szewczyk  <k@iczelia.net>

	* Initial bootstrap.
